Reader adapted from goodpjw2008/rsna-knee-2-5d-convnext-reader.
Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/goodpjw2008/rsna-knee-2-5d-convnext-reader
The source dataset identifies its license as Apache-2.0.

The original code belongs to its original contributors. This adaptation adds
package imports, configurable paths, device/precision selection, and fp16
gradient scaling. The core model architecture is retained. Additional changes include deterministic
DICOM ordering and interpolation, stable fold assignment, mirror augmentation,
gradient checkpointing, and configurable evaluation frequency.

The upstream source files supplied in the dataset did not include a separate
NOTICE file; this notice documents the source and the changes made here.
